  "title": "Require all Xingcheng data to remain in one canonical root",
  "summary": "Strengthen B81 so every category and lifecycle form of Xingcheng data resides exclusively inside one registered canonical custody root, with no external persistence, duplicate root, side store, cache or scratch copy.",
